"id": "1334999902070550", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1334999905403883_7825560239183096548_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OJXS9HkQUBoQ7kNvwHDsuOm&_nc_oc=AdpkxNc2Ky_TD868tuldHJ9V9wRv9VFhaE9bjVkR38dnuQBnzLNcWnn4EQPz9qgGJLo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRxAuyG658BSV10AJzzfR0ktxHT14AQy_kCKSNom14N3g&oe=6B0B19EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Bridge To One", "keywords": ["future", "climate", "education", "storytelling", "experience"], "long_description": "Bridge To One is an immersive XR narrative experience that places you in the space between possible futures. In this 12-minute journey, you witness three paths humanity could take in the age of advanced AI: escalating conflict, deep social division, or a cooperative abundant future rooted in shared intelligence, restored nature, and global alignment.\n\nThrough symbolic interaction, emotional storytelling, spatial audio, and personal reflection, Bridge To One asks a simple question: what future will we help create?\n\nThis is not a traditional game. It is a short seated experience designed to inspire reflection, conversation, and action around AI, cooperation, ecology, and human responsibility.\n\nYou will move through a guided narrative, encounter contrasting visions of the future, reflect on the people you care about, and make a personal pledge toward building a better world.\n\nThis matches the design doc\u2019s core structure: a personalized 12-minute Quest 3 XR journey contrasting war, bifurcation, and abundance, ending with reflection and a pledge.", "short_description": "A 12-minute XR journey through three possible futures shaped by AI, human choice, nature, and global cooperation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualworldsociety.org/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "V